  <spoon:CtClass name="SteamBoilerConstants">
    <comment xsi:type="spoon:CtJavaDoc" commentContent="Constants of the boiler, the steam exit, the pumps and the cycle. The requirements name&#xA;these quantities but do not fix their values; the values below are chosen so that&#xA;M1 &amp;lt; N1 &amp;lt; N2 &amp;lt; M2 &amp;lt; C and the four pumps together can exceed the maximal steam rate."/>
